[00:00.00] As this soul flairs, slowly it stirs
[00:03.54] From one cold look (To one cold shoulder)
[00:07.21] It burns as memories blur, speaks without words (Stalked and severed)
[00:12.99] Entombed (I saw shadows)
[00:19.48] Lift the veil of safety
[00:22.62] There is a rip run straight through the earth
[00:25.59] Born to the same and cut in silence
[00:28.68] This is a truth I can't hide
[00:31.17] I sing, and there is no melody (And I walk, but there is no distance)
[00:37.46] Watching, the whole world dances
[00:40.78] While I talk to myself
[00:43.39] 
[00:49.78] If there were an essence, it ran away from you
[00:55.79] Unheard, thе tired groans of a tired stare
[01:01.92] You gеt in your way, no patience
[01:07.50] 
[01:15.05] Poor and weathered
[01:17.76] By words that are never spoken
[01:22.93] A face that's fading, wading
[01:26.04] Gasping for air
[01:29.04] Exhumed, watch as it haunts me
[01:32.25] Bright lights wash over me
[01:36.12] 
[01:57.97] No more time to waste away
[02:00.29] I've been through these streets before
